      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/0944cbb283010fd427f2bf6df421ac1b/e7c3bd631af81d9b-e1/s640x960/5b5623cdde63d6d5cb278c60ffd6934355b697db.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"757\" data-orig-width=\"1400\" alt=\"Title: Who is Haunting The Library of Forbidden Tomes?   Image: five panels showing characters in a gothic library   22% - tormented souls, frozen between life and death (a ghost reading a book) 4% - dank, fetid horrors from the icy depths below (a black slug like creature with a single eyestalk reading a book) 15% - cold, lifeless bones possessed by a corrupt sorcery (a skeleton reading a book) 11% - frigid and malevolent ectoplasmic vapours (a shapeless apparition reading a book) 48% - regular readers happy to away from the heatwave (A mother, small child and toddler in buggy, all reading books)\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/0944cbb283010fd427f2bf6df421ac1b/e7c3bd631af81d9b-e1/s75x75_c1/5dbccd512f640d2c84e1cb9f8e6cfde782d3b5b1.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/0944cbb283010fd427f2bf6df421ac1b/e7c3bd631af81d9b-e1/s100x200/1fb9d9a3a5277bacc0f4a2892b628b51411264a1.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/0944cbb283010fd427f2bf6df421ac1b/e7c3bd631af81d9b-e1/s250x400/2a30bf0e50f90df42be023ff68561483c141127a.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/0944cbb283010fd427f2bf6df421ac1b/e7c3bd631af81d9b-e1/s400x600/dc4b6ca35dc08cc36dfedcf0fc6e830a861bcf5e.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/0944cbb283010fd427f2bf6df421ac1b/e7c3bd631af81d9b-e1/s500x750/5f085814d5e9cb9833bb2f720cda2cc632a9aa6b.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/0944cbb283010fd427f2bf6df421ac1b/e7c3bd631af81d9b-e1/s540x810/ea16f6c661f9ae415f8c39729d774ad494db9623.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/0944cbb283010fd427f2bf6df421ac1b/e7c3bd631af81d9b-e1/s640x960/5b5623cdde63d6d5cb278c60ffd6934355b697db.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/0944cbb283010fd427f2bf6df421ac1b/e7c3bd631af81d9b-e1/s1280x1920/f3320fb8e21c454cdf182891ebc9f1064ef30799.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.co